cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this ledger, cite it and the upstream sources it names."
title: "Climate ledger: the climate numbers the news quotes, recomputed from pinned sources"
abstract: >-
  A public, reproducible verification of climate numbers in circulation: each
  claim carries its source, method, recomputed value and a dated verdict. Sources
  are frozen once with a SHA-256 and recomputed offline, so results are
  reproducible rather than trusted.
authors:
  - name: Tim
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/realtimshady16/climate-ledger"
url: "https://realtimshady16.github.io/climate-ledger/"
keywords:
  - climate
  - carbon budget
  - emissions
  - reproducibility
  - open data
